 ### NeRF† Implementation Configuration
-A variant of nerfacto using a standard MLP density field instead of HashMLPDensityField [S6]. For the Blender dataset, near/far thresholds are $t_n=2.0, t_f=6.0$. Camera optimizer, appearance embedding, distortion loss, and scene contraction are disabled. Background color is white. Batch size is 2048 rays, initial sampler is uniform, and training is 16.5k epochs [S6]. For LLFF, camera optimizer, appearance embedding, and distortion loss are disabled. Scene contraction uses $\ell_\infty$ norm. Batch size is 1024 rays during training and 2048 during evaluation. Training is 30k epochs. For leaves scenes, uniform initial proposal sampler is used [S6]. On Mip-NeRF 360, nerfacto† achieves PSNR 24.20, SSIM 0.726, LPIPS 0.247 [S6]. It achieves comparable metrics to nerfacto but is significantly slower [S6].
